  <section class="section grid-two">
    <div><h2>Playing and learning</h2><p>I spent years performing and touring with extreme metal bands based in Boise, Idaho. I played with <a href={BAND_LINKS.wealdAndWoe.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{BAND_LINKS.wealdAndWoe.title}</a> and <a href={BAND_LINKS.aterrima.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{BAND_LINKS.aterrima.title}</a>, each of which challenged me in different ways.</p><p>I'm currently taking a break from bands and spending time on my own music. The curiosity that got me behind a kit in the first place hasn't gone anywhere.</p></div>
