  </section>
  <section class="section grid-two"><div><p class="eyebrow">Teaching</p><h2>Drum lessons</h2><p>I've taught drums since 2021, with an emphasis on technique, healthy posture, and musical expression. Lessons are shaped around the student's goals, whether they're learning the basics or refining more advanced playing.</p><p>For lesson availability and scheduling in Olympia, please <a href={SOCIAL_LINKS.facebook} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">contact me on Facebook ↗</a>.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3>What we can work on</h3><p>Grip and stroke mechanics, rhythmic vocabulary, coordination, efficient movement, and finding your own voice behind the kit.</p><p class="small">Lesson times and availability are confirmed directly rather than listed here, so the page doesn't show an outdated schedule.</p></div></section>
